| 04 | `dense_alt` | 40% | BLOCKED | ML only (heur 0.00) |
| 05 | `straighter_dense` | 3% | BLOCKED | too slow/smooth (vel 0.49, jerk 0.013) |
| **06** | **`mid_dense`** | **95%** | **PASSED** | **win** |

