| acceleration_mean | 0.326 |
| jitter_ratio | **0.505** |
| straightness_index | 0.164 |

**Why this missed V0.6 bands:**

| Rule | Miss reason |
|------|-------------|
| #17 | jitter **0.505** not in `0.08–0.22`; vel **1.24** not `<1.18`; events **111** not `>115` |
| #18 | jitter **0.505** not `<0.24` (family rule is low-jitter) |
| #19 | jitter **0.505** not `<0.16`; events **111** not `>130` |
| cycle 005 | jitter **0.505** not `≤0.15`; vel **1.24** not `≤1.05`; events **111** `<151` |
| Security 004 | jitter not in `0.06–0.24`; also micro-jiggle gate likely not entered |
| #11 | vel **1.24** not in `0.42–0.88` (jitter would otherwise match `>0.48`) |
| #12 | vel not `<0.92` |
| #14 | jitter **0.505** not `>0.62` |
| #15 | jerk **0.153** not `<0.10`; acc **0.326** not `<0.22` |

**Contrast with Issue 004 `mid_dense`:**

| | Issue 004 win (V0.5) | Issue 005 win (V0.6) |
|--|----------------------|----------------------|
| Extra motion | none | **lateral darts** (`dart_p` 0.28) |
| Steps | 12–22 / 4–9 alt | **14–26** |
| jitter | 0.14 | **0.50** |
| vel_mean | 0.95 | **1.24** |
| str | 0.22 | 0.16 |
| events | 156 | 111 |
| HC vs V0.6 | 0% (patched) | **92%** |

V0.6 assumed the next bot would stay in the **low-jitter dense-hop** cluster. Flipping to **high-frequency direction changes** (darts) exits that cluster while jerk/acc stay in a band the older flat-dynamics rules (#15/#16) do not cover (those need *low* jerk/acc).

